  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/01/IMG_1449.jpg\" style=\"height: 320px; width: 480px\" /></p>\n<p>Hacia las 19.30 horas de este s&aacute;bado ha ardido un contendor de papel y cart&oacute;n, por causas desconocidas, en la calle Alfonso Pallar&eacute;s de Onda, junto al Parque de La Panderola. Un Polic&iacute;a Local ha cortado el tr&aacute;fico y han acudido cinco bomberos voluntarios del parque comarcal Espad&aacute;n-Mijares en dos veh&iacute;culos.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendicontenidorpapercarreralfonsopallares/img_1425.jpg\" alt=\"img_1425\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendicontenidorpapercarreralfonsopallares/img_1426.jpg\" alt=\"img_1426\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendicontenidorpapercarreralfonsopallares/img_1428.jpg\" alt=\"img_1428\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendicontenidorpapercarreralfonsopallares/img_1429.jpg\" alt=\"img_1429\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendicontenidorpapercarreralfonsopallares/img_1431.jpg\" alt=\"img_1431\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendicontenidorpapercarreralfonsopallares/img_1432.jpg\" alt=\"img_1432\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendicontenidorpapercarreralfonsopallares/img_1434.jpg\" alt=\"img_1434\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendicontenidorpapercarreralfonsopallares/img_1436.jpg\" alt=\"img_143